      "comment": "LITTLE MISS MORGAN (2) comes here off the Vicbred Super Series where she placed in her heat before drawing on the back row in the final. Nicely placed and gets an ideal draw. VOLDAGHA (3) tackled a Vicbred consolation when resuming last week but has won when second-up before so should be fitter. Can enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position so look for improvement. CHAMPAGNES (8) won from this row three back at Ballarat and has recorded a win and a placing in two previous visits to this circuit. MAJESTIC MONARCH (1) broke last start but is aided by a good draw and owns a decent record at this circuit and distance.",
